# AutoFS config for the server COMP-SRV-PDC
# Automatically mounts COMP-SRV-PDC's SMB shares

# Written January 19, 2026 by walle
# Last updated January 19, 2026 by walle


# Accounting
Accounting -fstype=cifs,credentials=/home/jacobt/.credentials/COMP-SRV-PDC,uid=1000,gid=1000 ://192.168.100.3/Accounting

